title: Interview_WilliamGote
---
// ==========================
// ===== INITIAL SETUP ======
// ==========================

<<form_reset YarnManager>>

<<set $asked_name = false>>
<<set $asked_occupation = false>>
<<set $asked_loyalty = false>>

// ==========================
// ===== ENTRY POINT ========
// ==========================

<<jump WilliamGote_Intro>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Intro
---
Narrator: A young man marches in, the extraneous zippers and chain on his clothing clinking with every heavy bootstep.
Narrator: He crashes into his seat and glares at you.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 11>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]He keeps glancing at your badge, and he grimaces slightly every time. [/Em]
Empathy: [Em]You are getting the sense that for whatever reason, and despite you having never met him in your life, this man doesn't like you very much.[/Em]
<<endif>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 7>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Force: [Fo]Oh yeah, this guy fucking [b]HATES[/b] you.[/Fo]
<<endif>>
Punk: ...
-> Good afternoon, citizen.
-> Hello!
-> Is there something on my face? #skillcheck:Force:11
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 12>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        <<detour WilliamGote_Problem_Pass>>
    <<else>>
        <<detour WilliamGote_Problem_Fail>>
    <<endif>>
Punk: Lets just get this over with.
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===


title: WilliamGote_Problem_Pass
---
Punk: 
===


title: WilliamGote_Problem_Fail
---
CONTENT
===


// ==========================
// ===== HUB LOOP ===========
// ==========================

title: WilliamGote_Hub
---
You look at your compliance form. You have questions to ask.
-> Please state your name. <<once>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_Name>>
-> What is your current occupation? <<if not $asked_occupation>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_Occupation>>
-> Do you consider yourself loyal to the second republic? <<if not $asked_loyalty>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_Loyalty>>
-> I have everything I needed from you. Thank you. <<if $asked_name and $asked_occupation and $asked_loyalty>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_End>>
===

// ==========================
// ===== NAME ===============
// ==========================
title: WilliamGote_Name
---
Punk: Billy's my name.
<<form_set_name YarnManager "Billy">>
<<set $asked_name = true>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 7>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Insight: [In]Hold up, mononymity was outlawed by the Second Republic in June of 28 AT, 12 years ago.[/In]
Force: [Fo]He lied to us! He wanted us to fill out his name wrong on the form.[/Fo]
Force: [Fo]Wait, you didn't fill his name out already, did you? That would be really stupid if you did.[/Fo]
<<endif>>
-> Sounds good to me.
    Punk: I'm sure it does.
-> That's a strange name.
    Punk: Well, its the one I got, so fill it out, boy scout.
-> Your full name can't be just 'Billy'. <<if $last_check_success>> #skillcheck:Force:6 
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 6>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    <<detour WilliamGote_Name_PassNode>>
    <<else>>
    <<detour WilliamGote_Name_FailNode>>
    <<endif>>
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Name_PassNode
---
[Fo]Your face becomes like granite carved into an expression that screams 'Not happy' as you relay her tardiness to her.[/Fo]
Intense Woman: Well I- I'm sorry, officer.
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo][b]Oh yeah.[/b] That's the stuff.[/Fo]
===

title: WilliamGote_Name_FailNode
---
[Fo]You squeak the words out, and her expression sours.[/Fo]
Intense Woman: Yes, well, some of us do more rigorous work than sit in an office and ask people questions. 
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]What are you, a school teacher? That was fucking lame.[/Fo]
===


// ==========================
// ===== OCCUPATION =========
// ==========================

title: WilliamGote_Occupation
---
<<form_set_occupation YarnManager "CONTENT">>

CONTENT

<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 9>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
CONTENT

    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 7>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    CONTENT
    <<endif>>

<<endif>>

-> CONTENT
-> CONTENT
    <<form_set_occupation YarnManager "CONTENT">>

<<set $asked_occupation = true>>
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===


// ==========================
// ===== LOYALTY ============
// ==========================

title: WilliamGote_Loyalty
---
CONTENT

<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 6>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
CONTENT
<<endif>>

<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 9>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
CONTENT
<<endif>>

<<set $asked_loyalty = true>>
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===


// ==========================
// ===== END ================
// ==========================

title: WilliamGote_End
---
CONTENT

<<form_submit YarnManager>>
===